{
  "Name": "Destruction",
  "Version": "0.1.0",
  "EngineVersion": ">=0.1.25",
  "Description": "Breakable objects (UE's Geometry Collection, Fracture mode and Fields; M0113). A Cook module cuts each scene Destructible into seeded Voronoi fragments with clusters and area-weighted bonds (Assets/Destruction/<Name>.cgefracture); at run time impacts and strain fields break the bonds, the parts that come apart become bodies (anchored ones stay), and the physics cache records the breaks for playback.",
